{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名Google DeepMind工程師近日展示了一項頗具創意的實驗：他成功在一台普通辦公室激光打印機內直接運行了Google的Gemma 3 270M小型語言模型。該模型參數量約為2.7億，而實驗所用的打印機僅有14.1MB可用內存，卻仍實現了每秒超過60個詞元的生成速度。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587142.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.165707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133747+00:00","content_hash":"8a18bd2896b8c362bd33715820cfd97ff783349cba20058d6f625072b3c3ca43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}